OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fthis morning, occasionally heavy, with
OL,7,Fmist and low cloud around some North
OL,8,FSea coasts. Becoming mainly dry with
OL,9,Fbright spells this afternoon, feeling
OL,10,Fwarm or very warm in any sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry in the east with
OL,13,Fthe cloud well broken at times.
OL,14,FHowever, rain is possible, the rain
OL,15,Fmainly through the Trossachs and west.
OL,16,FBreezy and very mild.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FCloudy or bright with
OL,19,Foutbreaks of rain at times. The odd
OL,20,Fheavier burst possible and winds
OL,21,Fmostly light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
