OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBright spells and showers, some of the
OL,7,Fshowers heavy. A more organised band
OL,8,Fof heavy and perhaps thundery rain
OL,9,Fcould cross from the west on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
